{%- comment -%}
  Ring sizes for the product-page dialog and the Ring Size Chart page.

  One measurement table. Columns, in order:
  US | diameter mm | circumference mm | circumference in |
  UK (also Australia, Ireland, New Zealand, South Africa) |
  France (inside circumference in mm, rounded) |
  Germany (also Russia and Ukraine) |
  Japan (also China and India) |
  Italy (also Spain, the Netherlands, and Switzerland)

  Half sizes 3–13 are the chart on the product page. Do not recompute
  those diameters. Quarter sizes are for the conversion chart only.
  An em dash is a real gap in that country's scale, not a missing value.
  Inches are circumference ÷ 25.4, rounded to two decimals.

  Accepts:
  - class: CSS class for a table view
  - view: "us" (default), "convert", or "sizer"
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign chart_view = view | default: 'us'
-%}
